# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
# This project lives inside a OneDrive-synced folder on Windows, so the
# sync-and-thumbnail droppings are worth ignoring explicitly.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp

# --- Claude Code ------------------------------------------------------------
# .claude/launch.json IS committed on purpose: it is the dev-server config and
# anyone cloning this should get it. Only machine-local state is ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/state/

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary inspection pages (e.g. _globecheck.html) are throwaway by
# convention: anything prefixed with an underscore is not part of the site.
_*.html

# NOTE: there is deliberately no node_modules/ or dist/ entry. This project has
# no build step and no dependencies - everything in the repo is the site as it
# ships. If that ever changes, this file changes with it.

# Design-pass download, kept locally but not versioned
*.zip

# Claude Design canvas documents, kept locally for reference
_dc/
